# One-off local test/scratch scripts and Python bytecode cache — real,
# reusable dev tools (simulate-partner.ts, face_correct.py,
# copy-template-images.mjs) are tracked normally; this only catches the
# ad-hoc `test_*`/`__*` throwaway scripts and build scratch dirs that kept
# accumulating here (cleaned out 2026-09-13).
scripts/test_*
scripts/__*
scripts/*.pyc
scripts/__pycache__/
scratch_dist/
